{
  "name": "Maker and taker fees proportional to P(1 - P), a maker rebate, and where rounding lands",
  "rules": ["E-3.3", "E-5.2", "E-5.4", "E-7.9", "E-10.6", "E-10.11"],
  "notes": [
    "fee(r, t, q) = ceil(r * yesCost * noCost / (10^8 * q)) cents: r/10^6 x q x P x (1 - P) dollars, rounded toward +infinity (D-2).",
    "Steps 1 and 2: a maker rate above 1 000 000 and a negative taker rate are rejected (E-7.9).",
    "Step 3: the default schedule becomes maker -17 500 (a 1.75% rebate) and taker 70 000 (7%).",
    "Step 5: B sells 10 into A's bid at 30c (tick 29). yes 300, no 700. Taker: 70000 * 300 * 700 / 10^9 = 14.7, charged 15. Maker: -17500 * 210000 / 10^9 = -3.675, ceiling -3: A is rebated 3, never more than the formula.",
    "Cash before fees: buyerCash -300, sellerCash 300 - 1000 = -700. A: 10000 - 300 + 3 = 9703. B: 10000 - 700 - 15 = 9285. Account 0: 15 - 3 = 12, reported first in block 4.",
    "Step 7: 1 contract at 1c (tick 0). yes 1, no 99. Taker: 70000 * 99 / 10^8 = 0.0693, charged 1. Maker: -17500 * 99 / 10^8 = -0.017, ceiling 0: no rebate, so no cash moves for it.",
    "B is short 10, so sReduce 0 and sellerCash 1 - 100 = -99. A: 9703 - 1 = 9702 with its 1c reservation released. B: 9285 - 99 - 1 = 9185. Account 0: 13.",
    "Step 8: the schedule becomes maker -1 000 000 and taker 1 000 000, the extremes.",
    "Step 10: 2 contracts at 50c. yes 100, no 100. Taker: 10^6 * 100 * 100 / (2 * 10^8) = 50 exactly, no rounding. Maker: -50 exactly.",
    "The fees cancel for account 0, which is touched but ends where it started, so it gets no SleeveChanged. A: 9702 - 100 + 50 = 9652. B: 9185 - 100 - 50 = 9035."
  ],
  "setup": [
    {"op": "centTable", "tickTableId": 1},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 100, "instrumentId": 1000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 1, "cents": 10000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 2, "cents": 10000}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "commandId": "f1", "makerRateMicros": 1000001, "takerRateMicros": 70000},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "f1", "outcome": "REJECTED", "rejectReason": "INVALID_COMMAND"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "commandId": "f2", "makerRateMicros": -17500, "takerRateMicros": -1},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "f2", "outcome": "REJECTED", "rejectReason": "INVALID_COMMAND"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "commandId": "f3", "makerRateMicros": -17500, "takerRateMicros": 70000},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "f3", "outcome": "APPLIED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 29, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O1", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 29, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 300},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9700, "reservedCents": 300},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 29, "quantity": 10, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 29, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O2", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 29, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 700},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T1", "instrumentId": 1000, "tick": 29, "quantity": 10, "makerOrderId": "O1", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O2", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 10, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -300, "sellerCashCents": -700, "makerFeeCents": -3, "takerFeeCents": 15},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 10},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": -10},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 0, "availableCents": 12, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9703, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 9285, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 29, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a2", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 0, "quantity": 1},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O3", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a2", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 0, "quantity": 1, "reservedCents": 1},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9702, "reservedCents": 1},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 0, "quantity": 1, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 0, "quantity": 1},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O4", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 0, "quantity": 1, "reservedCents": 99},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T2", "instrumentId": 1000, "tick": 0, "quantity": 1, "makerOrderId": "O3", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O4", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 1, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -1, "sellerCashCents": -99, "makerFeeCents": 0, "takerFeeCents": 1},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 11},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": -11},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 0, "availableCents": 13, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9702, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 9185, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 0, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "commandId": "f4", "makerRateMicros": -1000000, "takerRateMicros": 1000000},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "f4", "outcome": "APPLIED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a3", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 2},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O5", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a3", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 2, "reservedCents": 100},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9602, "reservedCents": 100},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 2, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b3", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 2},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O6", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b3", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 2, "reservedCents": 100},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T3", "instrumentId": 1000, "tick": 49, "quantity": 2, "makerOrderId": "O5", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O6", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 2, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -100, "sellerCashCents": -100, "makerFeeCents": -50, "takerFeeCents": 50},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 13},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": -13},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9652, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 9035, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]}
  ]
}
